# Internal engineering documents stay local. Only the root README.md is published.
# Their version history lives in .docs-history.git, a separate repository with no
# remote; see scripts/docs-snapshot.sh. Keeping them untracked here is what makes
# an accidental push of them impossible.
*.md
!/README.md
.docs-history.git/
